{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/hectorrios-ui/sf-incidents-mvp/pull/3","repo":"hectorrios-ui/sf-incidents-mvp","number":3,"set":"agent","source":"cursor","title":"Fix SF-017: Conditionally include AI suggestion block in Slack messages","body":"<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\n## Summary\n\nFixes fresh-org deploy failures and improves Slack AI-suggestion formatting.\n\n## Deploy blockers fixed\n\nThe package previously shipped Custom Metadata **records** without the Custom Metadata **Type** definitions, so Apex and CMDT records failed on a blank org.\n\n- Added `Ops_Incident_AI_Config__mdt`, `Ops_Incident_Slack_Config__mdt`, `Slack_User_Mapping__mdt` (objects + fields)\n- Removed `Feedback__c` View override pointing at missing `Feedback_Record_Page1`\n- Replaced missing `nfParentCmp` with `nF_CreateCase` on Contact Record Page\n- Converted `Slack_Webhook` Named Credential to legacy Anonymous / NoAuthentication (webhook-friendly)\n\n## Slack formatting (SF-017)\n\nAI suggestion block is only included when a real `proposedFix` exists.\n\n## Redeploy\n\n```bash\ncd sf-incidents-mvp\ngit fetch origin\ngit checkout cursor/improve-slack-message-formatting-sf017-2c5f\ngit pull\n\nsf project deploy start --source-dir force-app/main/default -o <your-org-alias>\n```\n\nIf `Slack_Webhook` was partially created from the old SecuredEndpoint shape, delete it in Setup first, then redeploy.\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n[Slack Thread](https://uatfeedbackdemo.slack.com/archives/C0B0M1A5MFG/p1777490561476909?thread_ts=1777490561.476909&cid=C0B0M1A5MFG)\n\n<div><a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-6b3e938f-21b1-5a59-b176-519c176c2c5f\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img alt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-6b3e938f-21b1-5a59-b176-519c176c2c5f\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img alt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\n","authorType":"User","additions":471,"deletions":45,"changedFiles":20,"files":[{"path":"QUICKSTART.md","additions":166,"deletions":0},{"path":"config/project-scratch-def.json","additions":13,"deletions":0},{"path":"force-app/main/default/classes/FeedbackSlackService.cls","additions":24,"deletions":19},{"path":"force-app/main/default/flexipages/Contact_Record_Page.flexipage-meta.xml","additions":2,"deletions":6},{"path":"force-app/main/default/namedCredentials/Slack_Webhook.namedCredential-meta.xml","additions":7,"deletions":10},{"path":"force-app/main/default/objects/Feedback__c/Feedback__c.object-meta.xml","additions":4,"deletions":10},{"path":"force-app/main/default/objects/Ops_Incident_AI_Config__mdt/Ops_Incident_AI_Config__mdt.object-meta.xml","additions":7,"deletions":0},{"path":"force-app/main/default/objects/Ops_Incident_AI_Config__mdt/fields/Enabled__c.field-meta.xml","additions":9,"deletions":0},{"path":"force-app/main/default/objects/Ops_Incident_AI_Config__mdt/fields/Max_Output_Tokens__c.field-meta.xml","additions":12,"deletions":0},{"path":"force-app/main/default/objects/Ops_Incident_AI_Config__mdt/fields/Model__c.field-meta.xml","additions":11,"deletions":0},{"path":"force-app/main/default/objects/Ops_Incident_AI_Config__mdt/fields/Named_Credential_Api_Name__c.field-meta.xml","additions":11,"deletions":0},{"path":"force-app/main/default/objects/Ops_Incident_AI_Config__mdt/fields/Provider__c.field-meta.xml","additions":25,"deletions":0},{"path